self.KB_CONTENT["card:780094"]={"id":"card:780094","ty":"card","sourceId":"780094","title":"『生產入庫檢驗單憑證』中的『選擇FAX/Email傳送狀態 (C 1)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"憑證","keywords":["憑證","生產","狀態","入庫"],"y":"other","answer":"* 尚未購買『FAX/Email處理系統』(FEP)，則FAX/Email選項需隱藏不顯示。* 分為Y.已傳送、N.未傳送及全部三種傳送狀態。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
