self.KB_CONTENT["card:792938"]={"id":"card:792938","ty":"card","sourceId":"792938","title":"『品號成本低階碼維護作業』中的『途程品號 (MB010)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"品號","keywords":["品號"],"y":"other","answer":"* 此欄位僅作顯示。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:792974"]={"id":"card:792974","ty":"card","sourceId":"792974","title":"『每月標準成本查詢』中的『品號 (CST.LA002)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"品號","keywords":["品號","單位","每月","帶出"],"y":"other","answer":"* 自動帶出該品號之品名、規格、單位及屬性欄位資料。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:792192"]={"id":"card:792192","ty":"card","sourceId":"792192","title":"『國外訂單管制表』中的『選擇訂單日期 (COP.TC003)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"訂單","keywords":["訂單"],"y":"other","answer":"* 可點選(icon)或[F2]日期快手查詢所需要列印之訂單日期。空白表所有訂單日期均納入範圍。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
